{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Climb, fall and try again</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a physics-based, 2.5D platforming game where your goal is to\u00a0<strong>get to the top</strong>. But the path is anything but easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With precise jumps and an unforgiving environment, this game is built for those who chase the satisfaction of progress earned through skill and persistence. Every fall is a lesson. Every step higher is a small victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're casually playing looking for a challenge as a speed runner, the experience is built to be fair, fast and focused, with increased difficulty as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>New Game+ and Special Modes:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've conquered the climb, it doesn\u2019t end there. Unlock a tougher version of the core game with\u00a0<strong>special gameplay modifiers (</strong>that change how you move, jump, or see the world<strong>)</strong> and<strong> time trials.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\ud83d\udee0 LEVEL EDITOR - Coming Soon:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A diverse\u00a0<strong>in-game level editor</strong> is in development, allowing you to design, test, and share your own stages. Challenge your friends,  test your own abilities and see what you can create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726480/extras/example_video_gif.gif?t=1749769843\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\ud83c\udfae Key Features:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics-based, 2.5D precision platforming - </strong>vertically,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Smooth performance -</strong> on all sorts of hardware,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylized visuals -</strong> with occlusion culling and optimized assets,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimalist, responsive controls</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No checkpoints -\u00a0</strong>one mistake and you're done,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level editor (coming soon!) -</strong> for community-made content and endless fun,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speed-runner Friendly</strong>\u00a0- In-game timers and achievements</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Winner!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726480/0528aa3c04120b9683e1b751c2c1051c007a013b.jpg"},{"name":"Not Messing Around..","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726480/fc8ddc2650188b6b8979761cf7c52cf46afdb56f.jpg"},{"name":"Not so Stable..","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726480/d7ef4f0c1a61822d033d87a9360748565ca26021.jpg"},{"name":"Worth the Wait!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726480/c1dbe33419c033679972d5f91f888898d278066d.jpg"},{"name":"How Unfortunate..","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726480/7b2f54dfc9952bd8ba88b531227ff5ba40aab790.jpg"},{"name":"That Was Quick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726480/4de83cf9e76706b614426424742fe39b85087cc6.jpg"},{"name":"Fastest Out There!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726480/0aff18dab7dc8759e977e500f3a7b3023b359db5.jpg"},{"name":"Unbelievable..","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726480/0195cd72f907a32f6acea91fe738f3675cd340e4.jpg"},{"name":"That Was Fun","path":